  "body": "基于 [Anikku v0.2.0](https://github.com/komikku-app/anikku/releases/tag/v0.2.0) 的非官方 HarmonyOS / 卓易通 兼容构建 (preview 构建类型)。\n\n## 本构建包含的补丁\n\n- `0001-downloads-rename-fallback-for-saf-without-renamedocument.patch`: downloads: fall back to copy+delete when SAF renameDocument is unsupported\n- `0002-downloads-mux-video-in-private-cache.patch`: downloads: mux videos into the private cache instead of a SAF document\n- `0003-updater-use-harmony-fork-releases.patch`: updater: check this fork's GitHub releases for -harmony-preview builds\n- `0004-storage-app-private-location-option.patch`: storage: offer the app-private directory as a one-tap storage location\n- `0005-build-flexible-adapter-from-maven-central.patch`: build: resolve FlexibleAdapter from Maven Central instead of JitPack\n- `0006-downloads-hide-videos-from-gallery-with-unknown-extension.patch`: downloads: hide videos from gallery apps with an unknown file extension\n- `0007-downloads-share-downloads-across-entries-by-url.patch`: downloads: reuse a download held by another entry with the same url\n- `0008-updater-in-screen-download-progress-and-install.patch`: updater: keep the update screen open with progress and an Install button\n- `0009-downloads-background-keep-alive-silent-audio.patch`: downloads: keep the process alive in the background on HarmonyOS (silent audio + wake lock)\n- `0010-downloads-notification-speed-and-progress.patch`: downloads: Animeko-style progress notification with speed and progress\n- `0011-updater-no-background-auto-download-and-apk-cleanup.patch`: updater: keep the background auto-download from blocking the update screen\n- `0012-about-match-mihon-update-ui.patch`: about: match Mihon's update UI (no post-update dialog, release page for What's new)\n\n## 安装说明\n\n- 下载 `Anikku-v0.2.0-harmony-preview.6-arm64-v8a.apk`（华为设备均为 arm64）。\n- 包名为 `app.anikku.beta`，与官方 Anikku Preview 相同，但签名不同：**第一次安装前必须先卸载官方 Preview**。卸载前先在 设置 → 数据与存储 → 创建备份 导出备份，装好后再恢复；下载目录里已下载的视频不会丢，重新选择同一个存储位置即可。\n- harmony-preview 版本之间可直接覆盖安装；应用内更新会检查本仓库的 Release，而不是官方更新服务器。\n- 继续使用 Documents/Anikku 这类自选文件夹即可：本构建已把 ffmpeg 输出改到应用私有缓存再复制过去，并在目录重命名失败时自动改为复制。\n- 鸿蒙图库：设置 → 下载 → 「下载的视频对系统图库隐藏」默认开启，新下载存成 `<集>.mkv.anikku`（鸿蒙不认 .nomedia、只看扩展名）。升级前已下载的视频点同一页的「按上述设置重命名已下载的视频」补上后缀（下载进行中时先暂停）。\n- 同一视频收藏进多个文件夹（如 XvXun）：设置 → 下载 → 「不同条目间共用已下载的视频」默认开启，任一条目下载过的视频在其他条目里也显示为已下载并直接播放；删除请到实际下载它的条目里操作。\n- 不想在文件管理里看到任何下载内容，可改用 设置 → 数据与存储 → 「使用应用私有目录（鸿蒙推荐）」；代价是卸载应用时会一并删除。\n\n## 校验 (SHA-256)\n\n```\n8457571aa4684cfe0e780455601e813d618965fade1aaba73572e24cd802113f  Anikku-v0.2.0-harmony-preview.6-arm64-v8a.apk\n4d0f3e4418689597d280ccc4dcb0c6e1efec7fd895f91a772c27bd4627178907  Anikku-v0.2.0-harmony-preview.6.apk\n```\n"
